@worldomonation did you try waiting for delayed selector and then clicking the target element? (This workaround worked for me)

```
await this.page.waitForSelector('delayed element');
await this.page.click('target element');
```

@worldomonation - I see. Few snippets that could help:

```
try {
    await page.waitForSelector('delayed/optional banner', { timeout: 5000 });
} catch (error) {
   await page.click('target element');
}
```

```
const el = await page.$('delayed/optional banner');
if (el) {
   await page.click('target element');
}
await page.click('target element');
```
